    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_select_01",
      "hash64": "83926C2C80255817",
      "text": "Ms. Dendra!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_select_02",
      "hash64": "83926D2C802559CA",
      "text": "What’s wrong?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_02",
      "hash64": "FC40EEA601CBD301",
      "text": "Oh! Great timing, new kid![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_03",
      "hash64": "FC40EDA601CBD14E",
      "text": "Nurse Miriam here won’t try the sandwich I made![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_health_02",
      "hash64": "1441AA1DBE3359C8",
      "text": "Well, DUH! I don’t want to get a stomachache![VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_04",
      "hash64": "FC40F0A601CBD667",
      "text": "You won’t! Probably![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_health_03",
      "hash64": "1441AB1DBE335B7B",
      "text": "Uh, I still remember that “sandwich” you made\\nme with meat filling and meat for bread.\\r\\nThat one really messed me up bad.[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_05",
      "hash64": "FC40EFA601CBD4B4",
      "text": "I hadn’t trained in the art of sandwich making yet\\nback then! I was young and thoughtless and—[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_health_04",
      "hash64": "1441B01DBE3363FA",
      "text": "“Young and thoughtless”? It was LAST MONTH![VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_06",
      "hash64": "FC40F2A601CBD9CD",
      "text": "Sooo, as you can see, I’m not getting anywhere\\ntrying to persuade her.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_07",
      "hash64": "FC40F1A601CBD81A",
      "text": "Even after I went through that intensive sandwich-\\nmaking training! It kinda makes me sad...[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_health_05",
      "hash64": "1441B11DBE3365AD",
      "text": "She went through intensive sandwich-making\\ntraining?[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_select_03",
      "hash64": "83926E2C80255B7D",
      "text": "She worked really hard at it!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_select_04",
      "hash64": "8392672C80254F98",
      "text": "You should try her sandwich",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_health_06",
      "hash64": "1441AE1DBE336094",
      "text": "Ugh...[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_health_07",
      "hash64": "1441AF1DBE336247",
      "text": "I guess I have no choice if you’ve got one of our\\ncute little students on your side.[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_health_08",
      "hash64": "1441A41DBE334F96",
      "text": "So, fine. I’ll try your sandwich. Let’s see it.[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_08",
      "hash64": "FC40E4A601CBC203",
      "text": "Yesss! I knew you’d come around. Here it is...[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_health_09",
      "hash64": "1441A51DBE335149",
      "text": "*munch munch munch*[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_health_10",
      "hash64": "1445321DBE3676B7",
      "text": "It’s a little strongly flavored, but...I guess it’s\\nnot bad?[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_09",
      "hash64": "FC40E3A601CBC050",
      "text": "Woo-hoo! My training paid off![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_10",
      "hash64": "FC3D66A601C8B612",
      "text": "I’m so glad my sandwich pleases the great\\nNurse Miriam! I look up to you, you know![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_system_01",
      "hash64": "FEFC464555D2C634",
      "text": "You feel trusted by Ms. Dendra!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_11",
      "hash64": "FC3D67A601C8B7C5",
      "text": "Thank you for trying it! And thanks to you too,\\nnew kid![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_health_11",
      "hash64": "1445311DBE367504",
      "text": "Aaand she’s run off again. That was weird...[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0028"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "kizuna_battle_c_health_12",
      "hash64": "1445341DBE367A1D",
      "text": "But that’s just how Ms. Dendra is, I guess. She’s\\nalways coming into the nurse’s office with some\\r\\ninjury or another, too.[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
